cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: czip
abstract: >-
  A lossless compressor for directed, weighted graphs stored as sparse
  matrices or edge lists. czip entropy-codes a graph under a
  degree-corrected stochastic block model (flat or nested) and writes a
  versioned .cz container that is verified by decoding it.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-28"
license: MIT
authors:
